or operations within the SELECT, WHERE, JOIN conditions, or any part of the query that is executed multiple times for the same row. Upon examining the given SQL query, we can identify the following segments that match this condition:\n\n* `MIN(mi_idx.info) AS rating`\n* `MIN(t.title) AS movie_title`\n* `mi_idx.info > \'5.0\'`\n* `t.production_year > 2005`\n\nThese segments involve functions (MIN), operations (>), and conditions that are executed multiple times for the same row.\n\nStep 2:\n\nQuery Rewrite 1: """The SQL query rewrite rule applies to the given SQL query by moving repeated function calls or operations outside of loops, if applicable. In this case, we can apply Rule 1\'s transformation 3, which suggests storing the result in a variable or temporary table when using aggregate functions that are called multiple times with the same parameters.\n\nOriginal Query:\n```sql\nSELECT MIN(mi_idx.info) AS rating,\n       MIN(t.title) AS movie_title\nFROM info_type AS it,\n     keyword AS k,\n     movie_info_idx AS mi_idx,\n     movie_keyword AS mk,\n     title AS t\nWHERE it.info =\'rating\'\n  AND k.keyword LIKE \'%sequel%\'\n  AND mi_idx.info > \'5.0\'\n  AND t.production_year > 2005\n  AND t.id = mi_idx.movie_id\n  AND t.id = mk.movie_id\n  AND mk.movie_id = mi_idx.movie_id\n  AND k.id = mk.keyword_id\n  AND it.id = mi_idx.info_type_id;\n```\n\nTransformed Query:\n```sql\nWITH PreCalculated AS (\n  SELECT MIN(mi_idx.info) AS rating,\n         MIN(t.title) AS movie_title,\n         t.id, mi_idx.info, t.production_year\n  FROM info_type AS it,\n       keyword AS k,\n       movie_info_idx AS mi_idx,\n       movie_keyword AS mk,\n       title AS t\n  WHERE it.info =\'rating\'\n    AND k.keyword LIKE \'%sequel%\'\n    AND mi_idx.info > \'5.0\'\n    AND t.production_year > 2005\n    AND t.id = mi_idx.movie_id\n    AND t.id = mk.movie_id\n    AND mk.movie_id = mi_idx.movie_id\n    AND k.id = mk.keyword_id\n    AND it.id = mi_idx.info_type_id\n)\nSELECT rating, movie_title\nFROM PreCalculated;\n```\n\nIn the transformed query, we\'ve moved the MIN function calls outside of the original query and stored the results in a temporary table (PreCalculated). This allows the database to optimize the repeated calculations and reduce execution time.', 'time': 5.065239429473877}
